    "detailed_description": "<h1>JO\u0130N OUR D\u0130SCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>* Wizard War Online is an online role-playing game with many game modes and mini games.<br>* Game modes include Battle Arena, Broom Race and Air Ball Match.<br>* Each player sets up a room or logs into one of the rooms.<br>* If the room owner wishes, he can kick the players out of the room.<br>* When everyone presses the ready button, the room owner can start the game.<br>* Players can increase their levels by killing creatures or other players in the game.<br>* Improve your tactics, adjust your timing well and take your place on the leaderboard!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767220/extras/dea267dc09c0d58f3367e59a4f385746.poster.avif?t=1748454070\" width=600 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767220/extras/dea267dc09c0d58f3367e59a4f385746.webm?t=1748454070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767220/extras/dea267dc09c0d58f3367e59a4f385746.mp4?t=1748454070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2></strong>Wizard War Online offers players an incredible flying experience. Flying with a broom has never been easier, thanks to the flight system that can be directed with mouse movements. Get ready to have a completely different experience in the air thanks to the flight sensitivity settings that you can change according to your preferences in the settings menu.<br>* Battle arena: A large battlefield focused on tactics and timing.<br>* Broom race: Show your opponents how well you can race with the broom.<br>* Air ball match: Pass the ball through the opponent's goal by performing unique maneuvers in the air and score points for your team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767220/extras/bc820619edac58824ac91bce706790bf.poster.avif?t=1748454070\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767220/extras/bc820619edac58824ac91bce706790bf.webm?t=1748454070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767220/extras/bc820619edac58824ac91bce706790bf.mp4?t=1748454070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINI GAMES</h2></strong>* Mini ball rolling: Roll the balls on the platform and earn high scores with the right timing.<br>* Mini battle arena: A battlefield where you can attack your opponents and kill creatures on the field.<br>* Mini ball field: A small field where you can play fast air ball matches.",
