tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767220/extras/bc820619edac58824ac91bce706790bf.poster.avif?t=1748454070\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767220/extras/bc820619edac58824ac91bce706790bf.webm?t=1748454070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767220/extras/bc820619edac58824ac91bce706790bf.mp4?t=1748454070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MINI GAMES</h2></strong>* Mini ball rolling: Roll the balls on the platform and earn high scores with the right timing.<br>* Mini battle arena: A battlefield where you can attack your opponents and kill creatures on the field.<br>* Mini ball field: A small field where you can play fast air ball matches.",
